flowchart LR
    User[User browser] -->|HTTP request| Service
    subgraph Local["Local development"]
      Service[localhost:5000]
      Service --> Flask[Flask application]
    end
    subgraph Container["Docker runtime"]
      Host[Host port 5000] -->|port mapping| ContainerPort[Container port 5000]
      ContainerPort --> FlaskImage[Flask container]
    end
    subgraph Azure["Azure deployment"]
      Browser[User browser] -->|HTTP| LB[AKS LoadBalancer Service]
      LB --> Pod[Flask Pod]
      Pod --> Image[Container image]
      Image --> ACR[Azure Container Registry]
      Pod -. image pull .-> ACR
      Cluster[AKS cluster] --> Pod
    end
    Source[Python source + requirements] --> Build[Docker build]
    Dockerfile[Dockerfile] --> Build
    Build --> FlaskImage
    Build --> Registry[Docker Hub or ACR]
    Registry -->|pull image| Pod
